{%- comment -%}
Telegram HTML: only <b>, <i> and <a href> survive, and an href only to a link of the view model.
Every string is already escaped. Lines are written with {{ nl }}; tags trim the source's own.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture nl %}
{% endcapture -%}
